  - m_Id: 1957535761
    m_Localized: BE / <b>KI</b>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1957535762
    m_Localized: Felirat nyelve
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1957535763
    m_Localized: <b>Angol</b> / Magyar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1957535764
    m_Localized: Angol / <b>Magyar</b>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1957535765
    m_Localized: Vissza
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1957535766
    m_Localized: "Kil\xE9psz a f\u0151men\xFCbe?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1957535767
    m_Localized: Igen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1957535768
    m_Localized: Nem
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1957535769
    m_Localized: "1943. janu\xE1r 11.\nDon-kanyar, Vorony\xE9zsi ter\xFClet, Szovjetuni\xF3\n\u221235
      \xB0C"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 248548359512064
    m_Localized: Bajnok David
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 248548409843712
    m_Localized: Galusz Marci
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 248548409843713
    m_Localized: Barta David
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 248548409843714
    m_Localized: "Nagy Bor\xFAs Levente"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 248548409843715
    m_Localized: Benda Daniel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 248548409843716
    m_Localized: Boros Aron
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 253860416167936
    m_Localized: "\u201EA zord t\xE9lk\xF6z\xE9pen\nFagyos sz\xE9l jajgatott,\nVask\xE9nt
      \xE1llt a kem\xE9ny f\xF6ld,\nK\u0151v\xE9 fagyott a v\xEDz;\nH\xF3 hullott,
      h\xF3ra h\xF3,\nH\xF3ra h\xF3,\nA zord t\xE9lk\xF6z\xE9pen,\nR\xE9ges-r\xE9gen.\u201D
      - Christina Rossetti"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433111830528
    m_Localized: "Egy \xE9let"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688128
    m_Localized: "Egy \xE9let."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688129
    m_Localized: "Mib\u0151l \xE1ll egyetlen \xE9let"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688130
    m_Localized: "Tov\xE1bb"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688131
    m_Localized: 80
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688132
    m_Localized: "K\xF6r\xFClbel\xFCl 80 sz\xFClet\xE9snap."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688133
    m_Localized: 960
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688134
    m_Localized: "K\xF6r\xFClbel\xFCl 960 h\xF3nap."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688135
    m_Localized: 1000
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688136
    m_Localized: "K\xF6r\xFClbel\xFCl 1000 telihold. Ezer \xE9jszaka, amikor visszat\xE9rt
      a hold, ak\xE1r \xE9szrevette valaki, ak\xE1r nem."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688137
    m_Localized: 4000
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688138
    m_Localized: "K\xF6r\xFClbel\xFCl 4000 h\xE9tv\xE9ge. Azok a napok, amelyekr\u0151l
      azt rem\xE9lted, hogy \xF6r\xF6kk\xE9 tartanak majd."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688139
    m_Localized: 7000
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688140
    m_Localized: "K\xF6r\xFClbel\xFCl 7000 dal, amit egyn\xE9l t\xF6bbsz\xF6r hallottunk.
      Dalok a gyerekkorb\xF3l. Dalok konyh\xE1kb\xF3l, r\xE1di\xF3kb\xF3l, t\xE1ncmulats\xE1gokb\xF3l,
      temet\xE9sekr\u0151l \xE9s laktany\xE1kb\xF3l."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688141
    m_Localized: 10 000
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688142
    m_Localized: "K\xF6r\xFClbel\xFCl 10 000 ember, akivel tal\xE1lkozunk f\xF6ldi
      napjaink sor\xE1n. Bar\xE1tok, idegenek, tan\xE1rok, szomsz\xE9dok, koll\xE9g\xE1k,
      ellens\xE9gek \xE9s szerelmek."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688143
    m_Localized: 15 000
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688144
    m_Localized: "K\xF6r\xFClbel\xFCl 15 000 besz\xE9lget\xE9s. N\xE9melyik azonnal
      feled\xE9sbe mer\xFCl. N\xE9melyik \xE9vtizedekig visszhangzik a fej\xFCnkben."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688145
    m_Localized: 20 000
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688146
    m_Localized: "K\xF6r\xFClbel\xFCl 20 000 s\xE9ta egyik helyr\u0151l a m\xE1sikra.
      Iskol\xE1ba. Munk\xE1ba. A boltba. Valakihez, aki v\xE1r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688147
    m_Localized: 29 000
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688148
    m_Localized: "K\xF6r\xFClbel\xFCl 29 000 vacsora. \xC9tkez\xE9sek a konyhaasztaln\xE1l.
      Gyors falatok \xFCgyint\xE9z\xE9s k\xF6zben. \xDCnnepl\xE9sek \xE9ttermekben.
      Valami zs\xEDros egy bar\xE1tokkal t\xF6lt\xF6tt \xE9jszaka ut\xE1n. Egy j\xF3,
      laktat\xF3 \xE9tel valakivel, akit szerett\xFCnk."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688149
    m_Localized: 30
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688150
    m_Localized: "30 halott egy oszt\xE1lyterem. Annyi gyerek, ah\xE1nyan egykor
      k\xF6r\xFCl\xF6tted \xFCltek, m\xEDg olvasni tanultatok, vicceket sugdostatok,
      \xE9s a cseng\u0151re v\xE1rtatok."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688151
    m_Localized: 80
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688152
    m_Localized: "80 halott egy zs\xFAfolt v\xE1rosi busz. Az emberek, akik egy es\u0151s
      reggelen k\xF6r\xE9d pr\xE9sel\u0151dtek."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688153
    m_Localized: 250
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688154
    m_Localized: "250halott egy kisebb mozin\xE9z\u0151 k\xF6z\xF6ns\xE9g. A terem,
      amelyen egykor idegenekkel osztozt\xE1l, mik\xF6zben  gyerekkorod kedvenc filmj\xE9t
      n\xE9zted."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688155
    m_Localized: 300
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688156
    m_Localized: "300 halott egy tele utassz\xE1ll\xEDt\xF3 rep\xFCl\u0151g\xE9p.
      Mindenki, aki felsz\xE1llt, feltette a csomagj\xE1t, becsatolta az \xF6v\xE9t,
      \xE9s arra sz\xE1m\xEDtott, hogy landolni fog."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688157
    m_Localized: 1000
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688158
    m_Localized: "1000 halott egy eg\xE9sz iskola. Minden di\xE1k a folyos\xF3n.
      Minden tan\xE1r egy tanterem ajtaja m\xF6g\xF6tt. Mindenki, aki bent van."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688159
    m_Localized: 5000
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2153433216688160
    m_Localized: "5000 halott egy koncertk\xF6z\xF6ns\xE9g. Az idegenek t\xF6mege,
      akik k\xF6zt egykor \xE1llt\xE1l, v\xE1llt v\xE1llnak vetve, ugyanazt a refr\xE9nt
      \xE9nekelve."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
